---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<Layout title="Volunteer With Us - Basingstoke Repair Network">
  <Header />
  <main class="p-4 md:p-8 lg:p-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto main-bg">
    <section class="mb-8 p-6 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md">
      <h1 class="text-brn-primary mb-4 text-3xl font-semibold">Volunteer With Us</h1>
      
      <p class="text-lg mb-4">
        Our volunteers are the heart of the Basingstoke Repair Network. By sharing your time and skills, you can help reduce waste, build community, and make a real difference. We're a friendly and welcoming group, and we'd love for you to join us.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-brn-dark mt-6 mb-4">Why Volunteer?</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg space-y-2">
        <li><b>Learn and share skills:</b> Sharpen your own abilities and pass them on to others.</li>
        <li><b>Help your neighbours:</b> Get a great feeling from helping someone fix a treasured item.</li>
        <li><b>Protect the environment:</b> Every repair is one less item in a landfill.</li>
        <li><b>Be part of a community:</b> Meet like-minded people and make new friends.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-brn-dark mt-8 mb-4">Roles We Need</h2>
      <p class="text-lg mb-4">We need more than just repairers! There are many ways to contribute:</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-4">
        <div class="p-4 border rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Repair Expert</h3>
          <p class="mt-2">Are you skilled in electronics, sewing, carpentry, bicycle maintenance, or general tinkering? We need your expertise!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 border rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Welcome & Registration</h3>
          <p class="mt-2">Be the friendly face that greets our visitors, helps them sign in, and makes them feel welcome.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 border rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Cafe & Refreshments Host</h3>
          <p class="mt-2">Help create a warm, sociable atmosphere by serving tea, coffee, and snacks to visitors and volunteers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 border rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Event Support</h3>
          <p class="mt-2">Help with setting up, packing down, and making sure the event runs smoothly.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-brn-dark mt-8 mb-4">Ready to Join Us?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg">If you're interested in volunteering, we'd love to hear from you. You don't need to commit to every event – any time you can give is a huge help.</p>
      <div class="mt-4 text-center">
        <a href="mailto:info@chinehamrepair.org.uk" class="inline-block bg-brn-primary text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg hover:bg-brn-dark transition-colors duration-300">
          Express Interest in Volunteering
        </a>
      </div>

    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
